    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d23-a1-a1-a1">

                <pb facs="0079" n="19" xml:id="pg19"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram per cable.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Hale,.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-10-05"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >October</hi> 5, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>If new national government is peacefully established in full possession at
                    Madrid, and there remains no contending government in Spain, you will recognize
                    the new government <hi rendition="#italic">de facto,</hi> so as to prosecute any
                    necessary business affecting the government of the United States or their
                    citizens.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">John P. Hale</hi> Esq., <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
